---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Services | Chaparral Disposal Service LLC — Trash Pickup & Dumpster Rentals"}
  description={"Residential trash collection, commercial dumpster rentals, and disposal & junk hauling in Chaparral, NM. Flexible, affordable, and always on time."}
  canonical="https://chaparraldsllc.com/services"
  cacheStrategy="static"
>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services</div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Our services</span>
    <h1>Waste solutions for homes & businesses</h1>
    <p>Whatever you need hauled away, we've got a reliable, affordable option for it — backed by 33 years of local service.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Service detail cards -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid-3">
    <article class="card reveal">
      <div class="card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 6h18l-1.5 14a2 2 0 0 1-2 1.8H6.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-1.8L3 6z"/><path d="M8 6V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M10 11v6M14 11v6"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Residential Trash Collection</h3>
      <p>Weekly curbside pickup that never leaves you guessing. Reliable route days, friendly service, and simple monthly billing for your household.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Scheduled weekly curbside pickup</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Simple, affordable monthly rates</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Easy online bill pay</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article class="card reveal">
      <div class="card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 8h16l4 5v4h-3M2 8v9h3M6 8V5h9v3"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Commercial Dumpster Rentals</h3>
      <p>Flexible dumpster options for businesses, contractors, and property managers. Choose the size and pickup frequency that fits your operation.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Multiple dumpster sizes available</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Recurring or on-demand service</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Great for job sites & storefronts</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
    <article class="card reveal">
      <div class="card__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0 9 9 0 0 0-18 0z"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Disposal & Junk Hauling</h3>
      <p>Cleaning out a garage, renovating, or clearing a property? We haul away bulky items and debris so you don't have to lift a finger.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Bulky waste & debris removal</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Cleanouts & property clears</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> One-time or scheduled hauls</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Split feature -->
<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="media-frame reveal">
      <!-- PLACEHOLDER PHOTO: swap for a real photo of your bins/trucks -->
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532996122724-e3c354a0b15b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Waste and recycling bins">
      <div class="badge"><b>Flexible plans</b><small>Right-sized service for any need</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Built around you</span>
      <h2>Not sure which service you need?</h2>
      <p>Every home and business is different. Give us a call and we'll help you pick the right service and schedule — no pressure, just honest advice from a team that's done this for over three decades.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Free quotes & friendly guidance</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Residential & commercial plans</li>
        <li><span class="ic"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span> Serving 10+ valley communities</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="btn btn--accent" href="/contact" style="margin-top:24px;">Get My Free Quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span>
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq reveal">
      <details><summary>What areas do you service?</summary><p>We proudly serve Chaparral, La Mesa, Anthony, Berino, Mesquite, Vado, Chamberino, La Union, and San Miguel, New Mexico. Not sure if we reach you? Just give us a call.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I start residential trash service?</summary><p>Reach out through our contact form or call (575) 824-0887. We'll confirm your address, set your route day, and get you started — usually within a few days.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What dumpster sizes do you offer?</summary><p>We offer flexible dumpster options for businesses and job sites of all sizes. Tell us about your project and we'll recommend the right container and pickup schedule.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I pay my bill?</summary><p>You can pay online quickly and securely through our <a href="/billing">Pay My Bill</a> page, or contact our billing team at (915) 246-4689.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What are your business hours?</summary><p>Our office is open Monday through Friday, 8:00 AM to 4:30 PM. You can reach us by phone during those hours, or send a message anytime through the contact form.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2>Let's get your service set up</h2>
      <p>Reliable pickups, fair pricing, and a local team that answers the phone. Request your free quote today.</p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--accent btn--lg" href="/contact">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn--white btn--lg" href="tel:+15758240887">Call (575) 824-0887</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
